{"type":"npc","name":"Boltspiker","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":115,"temp":0,"max":115,"details":""},"ac":{"value":24,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":40,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"burrow","value":30}],"details":"earth glide"},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed","exceptions":[]},{"type":"electricity","exceptions":[]},{"type":"poison","exceptions":[]},{"type":"sleep","exceptions":[]}],"weaknesses":[{"type":"sonic","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["petran","voltan"],"details":""},"level":{"value":7},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>When vast storms of elemental electricity roam across reality, they are drawn toward substances that effectively conduct their might. Most of the time, the lightning that strikes out of these storms leaves nothing but destruction in its wake. However, when the lightning makes contact with the slumbering potential within conductive crystal, it can sometimes awaken a new elemental consciousness known as a boltspiker. The fusion of the crystal's stability and the lightning's vitality makes for a mercurial creature prone to extremes.</p><p>Boltspikers are tempestuous beings that are quick to develop affection for treasured people, locations, and objects, which they guard jealously. These affections often lead them to settle down for a while, becoming stalwart and reliable companions. But their loyalty is not destined to last; when they come upon something new that they wish to cherish, they abandon what they once cared for with alacrity and ease.</p><h2>System Shock</h2><p>A boltspiker's life often begins with tragedy. Drawn to living creatures by an instinct for love and protection, a newly animated boltspiker might innocently reach out to make contact with a new friend—only to find that the electricity that provides life to a boltspiker has the opposite effect on most other living beings. It can take a boltspiker some time before it learns to control the lightning that runs through it, allowing it to clasp hands with a friend without devastating consequences.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 45/100/180 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing), armor (medium), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Nature, Stealth)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, charisma, constitution, dexterity, earth, earth armor, electricity, energy resistant (electricity, vitality), light, sensory (darkvision), strength, throwing, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Nathan Rudd","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":2},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":15,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"type":"tremorsense","acuity":"imprecise","range":90}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":13,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":15,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":17},"athletics":{"base":15},"nature":{"base":13},"stealth":{"base":15}},"traits":{"value":["earth","electricity","elemental"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"med"}}},"_id":"DWWWNXYafjswVMIL","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/boltspiker.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Boltspiker","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":1,"height":1,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/boltspiker.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":